{% comment %}
  ZAVELYN HAIR CARE — Maya UGC Video Component (Section 7)
{% endcomment %}
<section class="zvhc-video-ugc-section" id="community" style="padding: 72px 0; background: var(--zvhc-ivory);">
  <div class="zvhc-container">
    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; align-items: center;" class="zvhc-video-grid">
      <div style="max-width: 580px;">
        <div class="zvhc-eyebrow" style="color: var(--zvhc-orange); font-weight: 800; font-size: 0.8rem; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px;">REAL STRAND STORIES</div>
        <h2 style="color: var(--zvhc-forest); font-family: var(--zvhc-font-heading); font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.8vw, 2.8rem); font-weight: 900; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 0 0 18px;">
          "The First Ritual That Actually Loved My Texture Back."
        </h2>
        <p style="color: var(--zvhc-forest); font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.55; margin-bottom: 24px; opacity: 0.85;">
          Watch community members and curly texture stylists incorporate pure Honduran Batana and Keratin Fibers into their wash days and high-humidity morning routines.
        </p>

        <!-- UGC Key Takeaways -->
        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 28px;">
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--zvhc-forest); font-size: 0.95rem;">
            <span style="color: var(--zvhc-green); font-size: 1.2rem;">✓</span> Melts effortlessly into dry curls without build-up
          </div>
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--zvhc-forest); font-size: 0.95rem;">
            <span style="color: var(--zvhc-green); font-size: 1.2rem;">✓</span> Real scalp comfort within first 2 weeks of use
          </div>
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--zvhc-forest); font-size: 0.95rem;">
            <span style="color: var(--zvhc-green); font-size: 1.2rem;">✓</span> Instant camera confidence for thinning part lines
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Compliance Disclosure -->
        <div style="background: rgba(1,93,71,0.06); border-left: 3px solid var(--zvhc-green); padding: 12px 16px; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; font-size: 0.82rem; color: #555; line-height: 1.45;">
          <strong>Educational Demonstration Disclosure:</strong> Video content represents genuine user demonstrations and styling tutorials. Individual results may vary based on starting hair condition, porosity, and routine consistency. Not intended as medical treatment for clinical alopecia.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Video Player Visual Mockup -->
      <div style="text-align: center;">
        <div style="position: relative; display: inline-block; width: 100%; max-width: 360px; aspect-ratio: 9/16; border-radius: 24px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.15); border: 4px solid var(--zvhc-forest); background: #111;">
          <img 
            src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0826/2483/9865/files/zvhc-3256807907799249-gallery-02.jpg?v=1795264420" 
            alt="Maya Zavelyn Ritual Video Demonstration" 
            style="width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; opacity: 0.88;"
            loading="lazy"
          >
          <div style="position: absolute; inset: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; padding: 20px; background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.4) 0%, transparent 40%, rgba(0,0,0,0.7) 100%);">
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
              <span style="background: rgba(224,243,84,0.9); color: var(--zvhc-forest); font-weight: 800; font-size: 0.72rem; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 999px; text-transform: uppercase;">
                ★ Stylist Review
              </span>
              <span style="color: #FFF; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600;">@maya_curls</span>
            </div>
            
            <div style="text-align: center;">
              <div style="display: inline-flex; width: 64px; height: 64px; background: var(--zvhc-orange); border-radius: 50%; align-items: center; justify-content: center; box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(253,85,10,0.5);">
                <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#FFFFFF">
                  <polygon points="5 3 19 12 5 21 5 3"></polygon>
                </svg>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div style="text-align: left; color: #FFF;">
              <div style="font-weight: 800; font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 4px;">"How I transform dry roots in 5 mins"</div>
              <div style="font-size: 0.82rem; opacity: 0.85;">Zavelyn Pure Batana Therapy Routine</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

